{"name":"Cub Scout","hex":"#4e6341","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Cub Scout","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A member of the junior division of the Boy Scout movement."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Cub_Scout"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cub Scout","blocks":[{"text":"Cubs or Wolf Cubs are programmes associated with some Scout organisations, imitating some aspects of Scouts but for young children, usually between 8 and 12, who are too young to be Scouts and make the Scout Promise. A participant in the programme is called a Cub and a group of Cubs is called a \"Pack\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Cub_Scouts_of_Hong_Kong_at_Scout_Rally.jpg/330px-Cub_Scouts_of_Hong_Kong_at_Scout_Rally.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cub_Scout"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/3613377_orig.jpg/500px-3613377_orig.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/3613377_orig.jpg/500px-3613377_orig.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Vietnamese Cubs","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A3613377_orig.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Indonesian_Cub_Scouts.jpg/500px-Indonesian_Cub_Scouts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Indonesian_Cub_Scouts.jpg/1280px-Indonesian_Cub_Scouts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cb/Indonesian_Cub_Scouts.jpg/500px-Indonesian_Cub_Scouts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Indonesian Cubs","link":"https://en.wikipedia.